            "text": "theorem outgoing_pressure_halfKernel (F : Profile) (R eta : ℝ) (hR : 0 < R)\n    {X : ℝ} (hX : 0 < X) :\n    OutgoingDilation.Pi F R (X, eta) = -(∫ x in Ioi X, halfKernel (OutgoingDilation.E F R) eta x)"
